  "text": "CG\nЦГ\nEN\nPress room\nAll news\nOrganization\nDocument library\nAccessibility\nHomepage\nMinistry of Foreign Affairs\nDiplomatic missions\nEmbassies and consulates of Montenegro and visa regimes for foreign citizens\nDominican Republic\nDominican Republic*\nEmbassies and consulates of Montenegro and visa regimes for foreign citizens\nEmbassy of the Republic of Serbia in Havana, Republic of Cuba\nVisa regime\nCitizens of the Dominican Republic must have a visa for Montenegro.\nDiplomatic consular offices of Montenegro are responsible for issuing visas. If you are unable to contact the diplomatic and consular representation of Montenegro, you can contact the nearest diplomatic and consular representation of the Republic of Serbia.\nHomepage\nPress room\nAll news\nOrganization\nDocument library\nAsk the Government\nPR contacts\nFacebook\nX\nInstagram\nYouTube\nFlickr\nePayment\neHealth\neGovernment\nеTax\neEnrollment\nCentral Register of Business Entities\nAccessibility\nSite map\nEnglish\n©Copyright 2026. Government of MontenegroOpšti uslovi korišćenjaThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and applies Googleprivacy policyandterms of serice.",
